  "_comment_controls": "Controls built 2026-10-16 from the approved mock-up. Each control is drawn into its panel's texture (tools\\make-control-textures.py) and gets an invisible click zone (a quad clone with the author's 'Collision' material, the technique his own click spots use) with an XML interaction: keys = ASOBO_GT_Interaction_LeftSingle_Code, knobs = ASOBO_GT_Interaction_WheelAndContinuousLeft (wheel / left-right halves) or _LeftSingle when they also push. rect = [u0,v0,u1,v1] in the panel quad, u from the pilot's left, v from the top. {i} = the unit's instrument index. WT21 events: DCP = H:Generic_Upr_<i>_..., CCP = H:Generic_Lwr_<i>_..., autopilot = standard K: events (intercepted by WT21APStateManager in the FMC).",
